        "original_id": "d6726e23-8e53-59f2-830d-b747c400e492",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dan McCafferty, Eddie Vedder\n- Bands: Nazareth, Pearl Jam\n- Albums: Rock 'n' Roll Telephone\n- Roles: lead singer, vocalist, musician, singer, songwriter, guitarist\n\nFacts:\n- Dan McCafferty was born on 14 October 1946 in Dunfermline, Scotland.\n- Dan McCafferty is a Scottish vocalist best known as the lead singer of the Scottish hard rock band Nazareth.\n- Dan McCafferty was Nazareth's lead singer from the band's founding in 1968 until his retirement from touring with the band in 2013.\n- Eddie Vedder was born as Edward Louis Severson on December 23, 1964.\n- Eddie Vedder is an American musician, singer, and songwriter best known as a member of Pearl Jam.\n- Eddie Vedder performs lead vocals for Pearl Jam and is one of the band's three guitarists.\n- Rock 'n' Roll Telephone was Nazareth's last album with original singer Dan McCafferty.\n- Dan McCafferty left Nazareth before the release of Rock 'n' Roll Telephone.",
